## Project Rules

1. Before writing to the design file, load the design tool's skills and follow `docs/brand.md` § Design file; afterwards audit the touched pages and screenshot what changed.
2. Every asset follows `docs/brand.md` § Production rules, which says what is generated as raster and what stays vector in the design file.
3. Published channel pages and profiles are read-only. Upload or change settings only when the owner asks for that exact change in the current conversation.
4. Recurring work becomes a project skill (`cos skill new`), written after the work has been done once by hand.
